          "value": "<p>The dragon breathes a translucent mist of potentialities that overwhelms creatures with visions of possible features, dealing @Damage[10d6[mental]] damage in a @Template[cone|distance:30] (@Check[will|dc:29] save). A creature that fails its save is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} on a critical failure) as it struggles with the visions.</p><p>The dragon can't use Destiny Breath again for 2 rounds.</p>"
